X:1
T:Blue Bossa
C:Kenny Dorham, 1963
N:First recorded on Joe Henderson's album Page One.
N:Melody and chords from a Real Book transcription (trillian.mit.edu,
N:song/Blue_Bossa), cross-checked against the saxophone-section score on
N:abcmr.sourceforge.net and a MIDI on hamienet.com (track 352864830517808).
N:Only the 16-bar tune is kept; the B section in the trillian file is an
N:arranger's addition. Bar 11 takes the extra F that both other sources have.
N:Moved down a fourth from C minor to G minor. The pickup is paid back by a
N:short last bar.
